  <div style="background: #888; color: white; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap; width: 140px; flex-shrink: 0; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem;">Preprint</div>
